{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polterparty</strong> is a 4-player, online co-op horror party game. You and your friends have inherited a cursed mansion teeming with mischievous spirits, deadly entities, and ancient secrets. Work together or against each other to survive the night by completing bizarre objectives, dodging vengeful ghosts, and causing chaos at every opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382670/extras/f1cf0adddc1d39be3e683cbf4e60dc5c.webp?t=1760447759\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf83 Chaotic Horror Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunted house filled with cursed artifacts, unpredictable ghosts, and dangerous traps. A constantly shifting environment and partygame chaos ensure no two runs are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc7b Unique Entities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a range of sinister spirits and bizarre entities, each with their own twisted abilities, behaviors, and weaknesses. Some hunt alone, others together and all of them want you gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382670/extras/fd9c098fe372e51650a7d88bdbbd0566.webp?t=1760447759\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Cursed Tools &amp; Party Tricks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everything from baiting trinkets and cursed potions to mysterious gadgets. Turn the tide by sabotaging your friends or working together to hold off the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f Haunted Mansion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a massive, interconnected mansion with secret passages, cursed rooms, and dynamic hazards. No hiding spot is safe for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382670/extras/21f3e22f065f80d87f87a423640862ff.webp?t=1760447759\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Modes &amp; Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle escalating challenges, spooky minigames, and optional modifiers to mix up your runs and keep every party fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d Co-Op &amp; Betrayal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to survive or take advantage of your friends' mistakes to improve your odds. Not everyone makes it out, and in <i><strong>Polterparty</strong></i>, that's half the fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3382670?t=1760447759","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382670/9a41df493805605b0fe217f159362d6aee7a8cf0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760447759","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382670/98ac8803b49d4b3ec969f0de4a1f8af16b6f23b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760447759","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382670/98ac8803b49d4b3ec969f0de4a1f8af16b6f23b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760447759","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polterparty</strong> is a 4-player, online co-op horror party game. You and your friends have inherited a cursed mansion teeming with mischievous spirits, deadly entities, and ancient secrets. Work together or against each other to survive the night by completing bizarre objectives, dodging vengeful ghosts, and causing chaos at every opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382670/extras/f1cf0adddc1d39be3e683cbf4e60dc5c.webp?t=1760447759\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf83 Chaotic Horror Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunted house filled with cursed artifacts, unpredictable ghosts, and dangerous traps. A constantly shifting environment and partygame chaos ensure no two runs are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc7b Unique Entities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a range of sinister spirits and bizarre entities, each with their own twisted abilities, behaviors, and weaknesses. Some hunt alone, others together and all of them want you gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382670/extras/fd9c098fe372e51650a7d88bdbbd0566.webp?t=1760447759\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Cursed Tools &amp; Party Tricks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use everything from baiting trinkets and cursed potions to mysterious gadgets. Turn the tide by sabotaging your friends or working together to hold off the darkness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfda\ufe0f Haunted Mansion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a massive, interconnected mansion with secret passages, cursed rooms, and dynamic hazards. No hiding spot is safe for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382670/extras/21f3e22f065f80d87f87a423640862ff.webp?t=1760447759\" width=616 height=23 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Game Modes &amp; Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle escalating challenges, spooky minigames, and optional modifiers to mix up your runs and keep every party fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d Co-Op &amp; Betrayal</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together to survive or take advantage of your friends' mistakes to improve your odds. Not everyone makes it out, and in <i><strong>Polterparty</strong></i>, that's half the fun.</p>","developers":["Eelsmooth"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3382670/77d332e08bcf25e6d48a528b82d4c488e0f7067c/header.jpg?t=1760447759","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3382670/985503466/dc12930e2bc8c9464e7be3fc0110e3f21923eaff/1750845798/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747237167","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3382670/985503466/dc12930e2bc8c9464e7be3fc0110e3f21923eaff/1750845798/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747237167","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3382670/985503466/dc12930e2bc8c9464e7be3fc0110e3f21923eaff/1750845798/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747237167","id":257139755,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139755/movie480.mp4?t=1747237167","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139755/movie_max.mp4?t=1747237167"},"name":"Polterparty Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257139755/7c6f7ada7297acd47abf7e8ae89896013d6a61cb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747237167","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139755/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747237167","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139755/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747237167"}}],"name":"Polterparty","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Cor